Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.58,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.64,0:00:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail a brand new dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to journey on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On your mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Camel of other things!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, on Earth, a legendary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.11,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath,\NThen we'll make some waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.94,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.70,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted,\NThen you're a winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And freedom is the only rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.82,0:01:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard it be so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.88,0:01:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a good verse!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on a wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing. Feel it's waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll be loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.42,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No one ever left behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day I'd make my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.90,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,In every world I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.38,0:02:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.64,0:02:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.02,0:02:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can save them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Rich, you talk a big game,\Ndon't you, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.48,0:02:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He turned his back on deck in two? Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.98,0:03:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Swim away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.52,0:03:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to you to save\Nour people, Shirahoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A bit late?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.46,0:03:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.32,0:03:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Donut, isn't Deccan on the\Nbrink of death right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If he dies or passes out, then no\None goes back to normal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.64,0:03:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,His power will go away, and the\Nship will stop following her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.32,0:03:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll hit the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you kick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.74,0:04:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you shouldn't have hurt Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.24,0:04:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You big waste of space.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.06,0:04:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How about another goose egg to match.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.70,0:04:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you drop your fat ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't get any\Nscratches on that hot body?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.44,0:04:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out! She's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.94,0:04:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time she used that magic wand\Nthing, she did some major damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.58,0:04:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Black ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.28,0:05:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's she doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She must be some kind of witch. A witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's rude, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.06,0:05:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How about Enchantress?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's much nicer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.38,0:05:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,More like advanced\Nmeteorology, you might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.76,0:05:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.26,0:05:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Squirt cloud prize, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.68,0:05:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, I'm dying! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.28,0:05:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let you touch me,\Nhee, or I'll be dried squid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Icarus,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.63,0:05:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,did you notice how\Ndistraught the black-suited
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,buffoon was when that\Nwoman fell to the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.32,0:05:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe we may have discovered\Nhis weakness. Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.22,0:06:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure she can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do the gruesome part!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.34,0:06:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,See,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.33,0:06:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,if you don't want to get yourself zapped,\Nyou shouldn't be playing with lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.48,0:06:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did something just grab me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.26,0:06:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Murphy, you can be dried squid instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.64,0:06:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.55,0:06:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me! Anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.38,0:06:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.81,0:06:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.73,0:06:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to the squid spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.96,0:06:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're standing\Nthere, could I see your pa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're on their side?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.68,0:06:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad I stabbed you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.36,0:06:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drain you dry, he! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:06:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:07:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,When my spear stabs you, you're supposed\Nto bleed out and turn into dry squid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,a skeleton i'm already dry as a bone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can that be here? Jeez,\Nwhat's the point of having
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,a bad-ass robot. If everybody's\Ntoo chicken to fight it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.76,0:07:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.60,0:07:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky Franky Come on, you\Ndon't know a super guy like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're one of their\Nofficers, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.04,0:07:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have the backbone\Nto fight me at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.56,0:08:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a squid, but I've got backbone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.74,0:08:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Backbone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.66,0:08:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We have that in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.40,0:08:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.86,0:08:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a bonehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.54,0:08:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd move away from there if\NI were you. Huh? Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.82,0:08:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I step in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's he doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have been the reason\NI couldn't move my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.50,0:08:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And who might you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.28,0:08:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.58,0:08:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You've just suffered a\Ndevastating headbutt to your foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, prepare to enter a world of pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes any moment now he can't\Nadmit he's getting stepped on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.48,0:09:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry i stepped on\Nyou he said it oh it's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.78,0:09:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,a special technique i\Ndeveloped for delivering
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,a headbutt where you\Nleast expect it i call it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the super soul headbutt\Ndon't give it a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.58,0:09:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, come out, wherever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for some payback. Chomp-chomp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no match for me on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm gonna chew you up\Nand spit you out. Starover!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.28,0:09:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not careful, there won't be\Nany ground left for us to stand on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.30,0:09:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to dig\Nthat many tunnels, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.72,0:09:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.78,0:09:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You all done?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Need some help out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, I bet I can catch this guy off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.62,0:09:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, almost too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.68,0:09:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rush you into the ground, Gibson!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.84,0:09:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Horn Cannon, out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.78,0:10:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, nice going!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So are all the tunnels connected?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.22,0:10:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.13,0:10:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, special attack, Green Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.50,0:10:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.94,0:10:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Skull Bombgrass!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.78,0:10:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you, Shorty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We already fought a tunnel digger\Nback in Alabasta, so we're pros now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Practice makes perfect,\Nam I right? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.22,0:10:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You trying to make fools out of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.16,0:10:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You screwed up my hard work!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna pulverize you\Nlike a little bug you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do some pulverizing myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:10:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bite that ugly nose off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.54,0:11:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's too bad you can't reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.82,0:11:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pack me up here, chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.62,0:11:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.24,0:11:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.10,0:11:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.90,0:11:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.94,0:11:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me treat your injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, dear. Don't cry. Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You need help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,These people weren't even armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.14,0:11:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell could you do this to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.48,0:12:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Her Majesty, is she safe now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.14,0:12:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.26,0:12:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.10,0:12:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But wherever she is, I'm\Nsure she's fighting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Charlie, what's going\Nto happen to Fishman Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.12,0:12:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we going to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.08,0:12:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.38,0:12:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from the island, Noah! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.46,0:12:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shura Hachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Noah falls now, it's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:12:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She came here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.52,0:12:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop swimming upward!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.82,0:13:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.73,0:13:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to change your\Ncourse before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.62,0:13:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.30,0:13:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Shura Hachi! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.82,0:13:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Touch Viceroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.30,0:13:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryuboshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.56,0:13:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan is set.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.38,0:13:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.40,0:13:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.98,0:13:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If Deccan dies, his\Nability will stop working.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.16,0:13:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I stabbed him so\Nthat the Noah would fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.94,0:13:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If she keeps swimming straight up,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.22,0:13:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the ship's just gonna crash\Nright into the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how far away she swims, the\Nproblem's just going to get worse! After her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.10,0:13:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go tell her what to do! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Shura Hachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.52,0:13:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We need Hachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.48,0:13:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.30,0:14:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you ruin this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.20,0:14:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's far too convenient for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.78,0:14:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Without even raising a finger, I\Ncan crush my enemies in one shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,including your meddlesome crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.10,0:14:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi, you've got\Nto swim through the side!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.90,0:14:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,She...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,she heard you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.94,0:14:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.34,0:14:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Useless mermaid, this isn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.58,0:14:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's pulling away from the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.66,0:14:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And just in time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.48,0:14:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.08,0:14:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.46,0:15:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna hurt, Weepy Hachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.78,0:15:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.98,0:15:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, please follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hold him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.00,0:15:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little further! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.24,0:15:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.72,0:15:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Anderdak, would you just\Nhurry up and die already?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.22,0:15:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart, I'll get my revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.80,0:15:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.28,0:15:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If I stop, I will be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.46,0:15:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship, it's starting\Nto move to the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.64,0:15:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.79,0:15:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My left hand touched you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.34,0:16:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.90,0:16:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to be my final target.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.04,0:16:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll run you into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.14,0:16:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I will chase you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.90,0:16:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,To the gates of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.00,0:16:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't give up now Shirahoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.62,0:16:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If it misses the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.82,0:16:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,that this was all for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.50,0:16:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I die, you can't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.90,0:16:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We were too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's folly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.60,0:17:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right on target, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there nothing we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.90,0:17:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this island will bring in a new era!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.46,0:17:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So he finally gave up the coast.\NNow his ability will lose its
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.82,0:18:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,effect which means the noah is\Nabout to come plummeting down
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.10,0:18:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,this is the end star hats for\Nyou and for all those who stood
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,in the way of my vengeance what\Nare we gonna do now i don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.40,0:18:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely there must be some\Nway to stop the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.94,0:18:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.76,0:18:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if you could stop it, you\Nwould still have to go through me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.56,0:18:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll stop you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If the noah falls it spells\Nthe end for our kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.90,0:18:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And the hundreds of years\Nthat were spent protecting
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.06,0:18:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,that legendary vessel will\Nhave been all for naught!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen well my sons!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship of promise, Noah, is\Nmuch more than some ancient relic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.22,0:19:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Centuries ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.44,0:19:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,a promise was made to a great man, and\Nfor our people to keep that promise,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.50,0:19:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the Noah is not to be moved from the\Nsea floor until the time is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.38,0:19:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even today,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,there is still much we do\Nnot know about this ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.80,0:19:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,including the means by\Nwhich it was constructed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.24,0:19:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, until its purpose is\Nserved, it must be protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.46,0:19:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It will, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.78,0:19:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear, you needn't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.86,0:19:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We will find out why it was\Nmoved and set this matter right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.46,0:19:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not enough to save my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I must save the Noah as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.02,0:19:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But whatever happened to that unfounded\Nbravado of yours? What a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.42,0:19:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.80,0:19:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to tear that thing\Nto pieces before it hits land!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you mustn't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.48,0:19:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you do have enough\Nstrength to destroy it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.18,0:19:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the Noah has a long history and its\Ndestined purpose is still unfulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.34,0:19:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.62,0:19:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a better way to\Nsave the island, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.22,0:19:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.66,0:20:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's more important,\Nthat boat or your people?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.10,0:20:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible that Deccan\Nis simply unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.68,0:20:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If we wake him up,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.12,0:20:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,we may have just enough time to\Nredirect the Noah before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what if he's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.42,0:20:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how are we going to stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to destroy the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you just stop and think\Nthings through not getting along
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.56,0:20:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,are we well while you're arguing\Njust know your time is running out
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.26,0:20:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This Man Karate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.34,0:20:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirozi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.82,0:20:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And Sea Drums!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, brother? Bomboshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.74,0:21:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat for a moment.\NI've forgotten about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This Man Karate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.00,0:21:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.56,0:21:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Move aside, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Second gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.06,0:21:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.84,0:21:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, jet pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The armament Huang protects\Nme against punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.52,0:21:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess this is too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta watch out for those teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.74,0:21:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Being underwater is not helping me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.80,0:21:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one way to beat this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.68,0:21:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.48,0:21:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So the little coward wants\Nto fight me on the Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.30,0:21:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, cause there's air on the deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Smart move, but I'm still smarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.82,0:22:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in there, I can beat\Nhim with the one hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.22,0:22:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it, he's cutting through.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.32,0:22:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.54,0:22:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So sorry to burst your bubble Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.40,0:22:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.64,0:22:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I going to beat him\Nif I can't even breathe?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.82,0:22:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You humans are nearly so tough\Nwhen you're out of your element.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.22,0:22:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're even weaker than a fish\Nout of water, one might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.22,0:22:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're no match for me, how\Ncan you hope to stop the Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.66,0:22:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.70,0:22:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to say goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.36,0:22:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.24,0:22:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.15,0:23:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me if that was rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.02,0:23:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whip Hachi, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.28,0:23:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Fukaboshi asked me to\Nhelp you in his stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.66,0:23:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.78,0:23:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is sick. What did\Nthose people ever do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.84,0:23:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,kind of heartless person values\Nlife so little what are they
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.52,0:23:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,doing I'm not too proud to\Nadmit even though your power was
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.90,0:23:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,falsely acquired I wasn't strong\Nenough to vanquish you But,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.90,0:23:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,still, I have hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.26,0:23:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Combat! Combat! Ultra Marie Technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.64,0:23:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What I don't understand, Heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.06,0:23:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,is how you can seek to destroy so many of\Nyour fellow men and still feel nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.18,0:23:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it you want\Nthat's worth killing for?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.18,0:23:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you stand to gain if Fishman\NIsland ceases to be? Stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.10,0:24:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start later! Oh really? Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.30,0:24:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to see me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.38,0:24:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.28,0:24:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ill-gotten stripe will never best me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.32,0:24:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A little late to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.62,0:24:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.53,0:24:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.38,0:24:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, you wanted our people\Nto rise up against humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.76,0:24:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This makes sense, even if it's misguided.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.30,0:24:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But now you would have\Nthe entire population
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.64,0:24:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,of Fishman Island be put to death instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.98,0:24:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There are people living in the Fishman\NDistrict who were once your allies!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.26,0:24:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What you're doing doesn't\Nbenefit anyone, not even you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.42,0:24:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you see that, Heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.34,0:24:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something I don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.46,0:25:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is your hatred so deep that you've\Nabandoned your sense of reason entirely?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.02,0:25:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me the cause of this madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.44,0:25:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Did humans attack you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.70,0:25:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they torment you\Nin some untold manner?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.54,0:25:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they kill your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.42,0:25:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they hurt your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.90,0:25:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they take something you hold dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.68,0:25:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.26,0:25:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What did humans do to you\Nthat was so unforgivable?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.24,0:25:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.15,0:25:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What in this world could\Ninspire such cruelty?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.04,0:25:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.50,0:25:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.58,0:26:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.20,0:26:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We are Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.18,0:26:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawhead Luffy, this is the air tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.16,0:26:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We've met before, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.08,0:26:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, hey guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.22,0:26:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been listening to\Nwhat's happening out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.58,0:26:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And we can see the Noah\Nhurtling toward the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.66,0:26:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We've begun making the\Npreparations as we've discussed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.52,0:26:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what Brother Hachi meant before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.60,0:26:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got business there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.08,0:26:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.90,0:26:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.81,0:26:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna go? Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.50,0:26:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We must be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.02,0:26:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we don't follow\Nhim, he'll get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.36,0:26:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Horty's obviously up to something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.82,0:26:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And more importantly, we have to be\Nready to face him underwater again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.82,0:26:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.16,0:26:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.58,0:26:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.12,0:26:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.50,0:26:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Hachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.60,0:26:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Fukaboshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.84,0:27:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.78,0:27:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite possible that we're going to\Nneed a large amount of air very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.80,0:27:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Please make arrangements for us. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.88,0:27:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.42,0:27:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's supposed to be some\Nair on the deck, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.72,0:27:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could breathe, there's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.38,0:27:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Deccan needs the bubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.92,0:27:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That much is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.38,0:27:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Heart may still destroy\Nit if worse comes to worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.98,0:27:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this baby transponder snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.36,0:27:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be our last resort in\Nthe event that things go poorly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.74,0:27:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We must be prepared for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.96,0:27:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy, I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.86,0:27:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, what do we need to\Ndo to get a little air from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.70,0:27:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We can shoot out all\Nthe air in the air tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.58,0:27:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that thing for, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.22,0:27:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an air conditioning facility\Nthat provides air for Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.68,0:27:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If we create a big bubble and shoot\Nit, maybe it'll surround the NOAA.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.72,0:27:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.63,0:27:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,the bubble would neutralize\Nascending forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.04,0:28:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's not going to make the\NNOAA stop or reverse course.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.10,0:28:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.28,0:28:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,we'd have to use all the air we've got to
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.14,0:28:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,make the bubble big\Nenough to hold the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.22,0:28:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and it would crash long\Nbefore we could resupply.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.38,0:28:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What I mean is we've got only one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.14,0:28:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't manage to\Nsend out the bubble at the
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.42,0:28:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,exact moment the NOAA moves\Nclosest to the air tank,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.10,0:28:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ben, we're done. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.62,0:28:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All riding on one shot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.58,0:28:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, better not miss. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.36,0:28:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that's all we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.20,0:28:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,After we deploy the bubble,\Nthe rest is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.80,0:28:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I should reiterate, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.86,0:28:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make it more complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.64,0:28:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go for it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.00,0:28:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can breathe, I'll make this work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.78,0:28:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.14,0:28:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do our best not to miss the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.58,0:28:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And Luffy, everyone\Nhere is counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.28,0:28:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're swimming alongside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.12,0:28:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a lowly human\Nand a cowardly mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.18,0:28:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What can you two possibly\Nhope to accomplish now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.02,0:28:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shark Traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.00,0:28:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.66,0:29:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Superman Horsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.50,0:29:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.00,0:29:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He got even bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.82,0:29:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.70,0:29:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.74,0:29:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the sight of you vile worms\Nmakes me sick to my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.84,0:29:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it shortens my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.20,0:29:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and even if I have to sacrifice\Neverything in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.64,0:29:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear to you, I will have my\Nrevenge against the human race.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.58,0:29:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.24,0:30:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You've only got one shot,\Nso you better not miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.40,0:30:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If this doesn't work, the\Nwhole island's done for?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.46,0:30:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.70,0:30:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, that's my brother's\Nvoice. Hey, buddy, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.96,0:30:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm barely alive, but please listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.74,0:30:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He spoke earlier and...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.56,0:30:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's clear now who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.02,0:30:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
